WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.546
Which of these numbers goes into the search index?

00:00:36.546 --> 00:01:08.260
One name, two different jobs

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:44.863
A string can be split without being understood

00:01:44.863 --> 00:02:24.587
Token IDs are lookup keys, not search coordinates

00:02:24.587 --> 00:03:04.683
Six working vectors become one representation

00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:39.558
A question and passage can be encoded separately

00:03:39.558 --> 00:04:18.400
One stored vector is a design choice
